Metadata reservation records also grow incrementally with accepted
entries instead of reserving the entire footer-declared count at once.
Synthetic tests cover a 9,001-byte member, subsequent smaller member
reuse, and unchanged contents after an overflowing reservation request.
The original Simpsons archive still admits 14 members and 7,209,088
bytes. Fresh validation passed in run 1795606389885141764-59056.

Conversion admission now validates the borrowed logical key, format and
