syncing and again at completion. Synthetic cases replace a payload with
a FIFO, directory, symlink, hardlink, short or long file, or writable
file; completion rejects each without affecting an unrelated sentinel.
This detects observed metadata changes, not same-length content swaps or
all concurrent same-user races; private staging remains trusted.
